WEBVTT

01:36.160 --> 01:40.120
EPISODE 10: THE CURSE OF RELICS

01:36.300 --> 01:38.930
You can relax now. I'm here.

01:38.930 --> 01:40.680
R-Ryoga-san...

01:42.830 --> 01:47.200
Oh, my brother, we meet again!

01:47.200 --> 01:48.250
Don't!

01:49.240 --> 01:51.260
You'll turn to gold, too!

01:51.260 --> 01:54.830
Human! You still have time.

01:54.830 --> 01:57.560
Leave my brother and get out of the water!

01:57.560 --> 02:00.000
Come to me, brother!

02:00.570 --> 02:02.390
I welcome you!

02:03.790 --> 02:04.900
Ryoga-san...

02:07.480 --> 02:09.400
I get it now, Irene-san.

02:09.730 --> 02:13.400
I was wondering what all 
this talk of a brother meant.

02:13.790 --> 02:17.540
If I'm right, Midas's relic 
was split in two:

02:18.190 --> 02:22.040
the Hand of Gold and 
the Hand of Bankruptcy.

02:22.040 --> 02:25.170
Only the latter attached itself to you.

02:25.480 --> 02:26.730
What?

02:26.730 --> 02:31.420
The Hand of Gold is trying to kill you 
to save the Hand of Bankruptcy.

02:31.420 --> 02:33.960
So we'll do the exact opposite.

02:33.960 --> 02:37.680
You will subdue the Hand of 
Gold with your dominance.

02:37.680 --> 02:40.680
What? But I can't do that!

02:40.990 --> 02:43.240
I'll help you!

02:44.810 --> 02:49.320
Focus on making that relic 
bend to your control!

02:50.470 --> 02:52.280
I can't do this!

02:52.280 --> 02:54.780
You can! Trust me!

02:56.380 --> 03:00.720
That hurts! What are you doing, human?!

03:00.720 --> 03:03.090
Focus harder, Irene-san!

03:03.090 --> 03:07.040
We can only do this if we work together!

03:07.770 --> 03:13.050
<i>I have to focus harder. I can do this!</i>

03:14.300 --> 03:16.840
Are you insane?!

03:16.840 --> 03:19.350
Good! Keep it up!

03:19.350 --> 03:20.450
Boss!

03:21.560 --> 03:25.060
What are you trying to do?! Stop it!

03:25.060 --> 03:26.350
Submit!

03:27.060 --> 03:28.400
No!

03:29.900 --> 03:32.230
Enough of this pointless resistance!

03:33.030 --> 03:35.780
Submit to me!

03:36.620 --> 03:38.030
Irene-san!

03:54.990 --> 03:56.780
M-My hand...

03:58.950 --> 04:01.170
Looks like we did it.

04:03.820 --> 04:05.640
The tattoo changed.

04:06.640 --> 04:08.940
That's proof that the contract is now—

04:09.450 --> 04:11.300
Thank you!

04:11.300 --> 04:13.130
I owe it all to you!

04:13.130 --> 04:14.310
Well... yeah.

04:23.460 --> 04:26.790
What? We lost contact 
with the men at the tomb?

04:27.100 --> 04:29.790
Yes, um... well...

04:31.000 --> 04:33.290
<i>Goriki Ryoga got us.</i>

04:35.110 --> 04:40.370
Order every unit within a one-kilometer 
radius of the tomb to pull out.

04:41.080 --> 04:42.960
General, are you saying...

04:42.960 --> 04:46.310
We can't! That would 
destroy the entire tomb!

04:46.310 --> 04:47.470
Silence.

04:47.890 --> 04:49.810
Now that it's come to this...

04:53.270 --> 04:56.070
Are we done? Then let's get out of here.

04:56.480 --> 05:00.570
I know, I know. But what's the rush?

05:00.570 --> 05:04.400
I just know something else is
gonna happen if we stick around!

05:06.090 --> 05:08.420
We'll be fine. Don't worry.

05:08.420 --> 05:11.250
This time, I won't let 
any of my people die.

05:12.640 --> 05:14.750
"This time"?

05:16.090 --> 05:17.260
THE SAVAGE GODDESS'S CURSE SEEPS INTO THE TOMB.

05:20.620 --> 05:23.510
What's going on? Wait, that's no earthquake!

05:24.660 --> 05:27.260
<i>Damn it, did she catch on already?</i>

05:27.260 --> 05:27.770
THE SAVAGE GODDESS OF DESTRUCTION
ATTACKS THE TOMB.

05:27.430 --> 05:29.680
ALL ENTRANCES AND EXITS WERE 
DESTROYED BY THE GODDESS'S POWER.

05:29.680 --> 05:31.770
THE SAVAGE GODDESS'S CURSE 
SEEPS INTO THE TOMB.

05:32.500 --> 05:33.880
It's gonna cave in!

05:33.880 --> 05:35.400
This is Kiera's doing.

05:35.400 --> 05:37.090
Run! We have to get out!

05:39.070 --> 05:41.610
But didn't you destroy her maps?!

05:41.610 --> 05:43.030
Only three of them!

05:46.620 --> 05:49.790
<i>Kiera's real weapon is the Sekhmet Relic.</i>

05:50.500 --> 05:52.690
<i>As long as she knows the location,</i>

05:52.690 --> 05:55.800
<i>she can attack her target 
regardless of distance.</i>

05:56.240 --> 06:00.300
<i>That's exactly why she was 
so obsessed with map relics.</i>

06:13.810 --> 06:16.060
<i>H-Hello? General?</i>

06:17.210 --> 06:19.380
<i>What is going on here?</i>

06:19.380 --> 06:21.860
<i>Where are your parents, little girl?</i>

06:22.940 --> 06:24.430
<i>Oh, for the love of...</i>

06:24.430 --> 06:26.670
This is General Kiera.

06:26.670 --> 06:27.410
<i>What?</i>

06:28.090 --> 06:31.080
It's a side effect of the Sekhmet Relic.

06:31.080 --> 06:33.660
This information has been 
strictly classified until now.

06:34.830 --> 06:36.430
<i>I see.</i>

06:36.430 --> 06:41.830
<i>She used that relic, huh?
So if she used that kind of power...</i>

06:41.830 --> 06:43.880
<i>Did she kill Goriki Ryoga?!</i>

06:47.000 --> 06:49.210
The targets appear to have escaped.

06:54.850 --> 06:57.940
She is asking about Pandora's status.

06:59.520 --> 07:02.200
<i>How did you understand that?</i>

07:03.110 --> 07:04.520
<i>Anyway...</i>

07:05.480 --> 07:10.920
<i>As for Pandora, everything is ready. 
We can begin at any time.</i>

07:12.080 --> 07:16.580
<i>The international tomb organization 
"Pandora" celebrated its launch today.</i>

07:16.870 --> 07:21.490
<i>Relics are a dangerous factor 
that bring great chaos to the world.</i>

07:21.490 --> 07:25.610
<i>Therefore, from this moment on, 
the public is strictly forbidden</i>

07:25.610 --> 07:29.010
<i>from approaching tombs 
or possessing relics.</i>

07:29.280 --> 07:34.640
<i>Violators will be treated as terrorists 
and punished accordingly.</i>

07:34.640 --> 07:39.560
<i>From today onward, Pandora is committed 
to protecting humanity from relics.</i>

07:41.510 --> 07:42.730
<i>Bullshit.</i>

07:43.090 --> 07:47.660
<i>Protect humanity? Those greedy bastards 
just want the relics for themselves.</i>

07:50.170 --> 07:55.250
<i>Without the "Tomb Restoration" skill, 
things would've gone very badly.</i>

07:59.810 --> 08:04.740
<i>And here I thought it'd be useless.</i>

08:05.770 --> 08:07.720
<i>But it saved our lives.</i>

08:06.130 --> 08:08.630
"TOMB RESTORATION" (RANK F) HAS BEEN UNLOCKED.

08:09.270 --> 08:10.400
Boss.

08:11.020 --> 08:12.140
We'll be landing soon.

08:15.880 --> 08:18.640
I sense relic energy at the airport.

08:18.640 --> 08:20.150
What?

08:33.660 --> 08:36.200
Don't be so nervous.

08:40.920 --> 08:43.020
International Tomb Organization, Pandora.

08:43.020 --> 08:46.120
If you are carrying any relics, 
hand them over immediately!

08:46.710 --> 08:50.030
Oh, come on. What is this now? Pandora?

08:50.030 --> 08:52.630
What gives you the right to do this?

08:53.810 --> 08:55.630
You don't know that relics holders

08:55.630 --> 08:59.480
are banned from entering 
for everyone's safety?!

08:59.810 --> 09:02.940
Man, you people just keep 
coming up with new tricks.

09:03.280 --> 09:04.440
Irene-san.

09:07.440 --> 09:10.400
Don't bother trying anything!
Hand over your relics at once!

09:12.710 --> 09:13.740
Now.

09:22.010 --> 09:27.850
<i>Breaking news. An explosion occurred at 
John F. Kennedy Airport 30 minutes ago.</i>

09:27.850 --> 09:30.500
<i>No casualties have been reported so far.</i>

09:30.500 --> 09:33.970
<i>The government suspects 
a relic to be the cause</i>

09:34.310 --> 09:40.960
<i>and is holding Pandora responsible 
for its poor handling of relics.</i>

09:43.240 --> 09:47.480
They blamed it all on Pandora. 
Serves them right.

09:47.970 --> 09:50.530
Did I do a good job?

09:50.930 --> 09:55.530
Yes, of course. 
Even better than I expected.

09:56.170 --> 09:58.920
Oh, good. I was worried that—

10:00.830 --> 10:02.380
I-I can't breathe...

10:02.380 --> 10:03.540
Irene-san?!

10:03.800 --> 10:05.160
Ms. Holton!

10:05.620 --> 10:06.540
What's going on?

10:06.980 --> 10:08.550
Irene-san, are you okay?

10:09.590 --> 10:11.050
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

10:12.190 --> 10:15.310
<i>How could I forget about the risk?</i>

10:15.310 --> 10:19.150
<i>Relics don't lend people 
their power for free.</i>

10:19.810 --> 10:22.920
<i>And that explosion required 
an enormous amount of power,</i>

10:22.920 --> 10:24.690
<i>which means an equally high risk.</i>

10:25.640 --> 10:29.180
<i>The problem is, you never know 
beforehand what price you'll have to pay.</i>

10:30.930 --> 10:33.240
Irene-san, breathe slowly.

10:35.310 --> 10:38.090
<i>I have to find out what 
kind of risk this is.</i>

10:38.090 --> 10:40.700
<i>Is the relic causing her physical pain?</i>

10:43.270 --> 10:44.580
Come to your senses!

10:48.750 --> 10:51.050
I-Irene-san?

10:55.000 --> 10:56.800
W-Wait a minute!

10:56.800 --> 10:59.710
Irene-san... um... are you all right?

11:02.230 --> 11:03.230
Boss!

11:07.850 --> 11:11.600
<i>What the... Is she smelling me?</i>

11:11.600 --> 11:13.270
You okay, Boss?

11:13.270 --> 11:16.220
Y-Yeah, I think so.

11:24.040 --> 11:28.670
WHEN MIDAS'S RELIC IS USED, THE USER IS OVERCOME BY INSATIABLE GREED.
THEY CRAVE WHAT THEY HAVE ALWAYS WANTED EVEN MORE INTENSELY
AND MAY TAKE ENTIRELY UNPREDICTABLE ACTIONS.

11:25.380 --> 11:26.680
<i>Insatiable greed?</i>

11:30.170 --> 11:33.170
IN THIS CASE, THE USER
CRAVED YOUR SCENT.

11:31.770 --> 11:33.170
<i>My... scent?</i>

11:50.290 --> 11:54.110
I'm so sorry, Ryoga-san. 
I don't know what came over me.

11:54.110 --> 11:57.780
It's all right. The relic made you do it.

11:57.780 --> 11:59.150
But tell me...

12:00.860 --> 12:03.870
Do you have a thing 
for the smell of sweat?

12:03.870 --> 12:04.900
What?

12:04.900 --> 12:06.610
Ah, forget it.

12:22.640 --> 12:25.080
Wh-What the hell?!

12:25.080 --> 12:27.480
Boss, this is the Holton estate!

12:27.900 --> 12:30.980
C-Can't I just wait in the car?

12:31.580 --> 12:34.480
If George Holton catches me, I'm dead.

12:34.890 --> 12:38.280
Don't worry. My brother isn't home today.

12:38.670 --> 12:42.890
Stop talking nonsense and get out. 
We'll be dealing with the Holtons often.

12:42.890 --> 12:45.040
How long do you plan to hide?

12:46.110 --> 12:47.540
B-But...

12:52.460 --> 12:54.440
Well, well. Who do we have here?

12:57.130 --> 13:00.910
The back of that head looks familiar.

13:00.910 --> 13:01.640
George!

13:01.640 --> 13:04.760
Oh, hi! What a surprise!

13:04.760 --> 13:06.100
How have you been?

13:06.100 --> 13:09.080
What are you doing here?
I thought you were at home.

13:09.080 --> 13:14.890
I was called over. Sure wasn't 
expecting to see this scammer again.

13:14.890 --> 13:17.690
Irene, call the police. Now.

13:17.690 --> 13:18.660
Um...

13:18.660 --> 13:22.110
I'm so sorry, George! 
I did a terrible thing to you!

13:22.110 --> 13:24.870
I apologize from the bottom 
of my heart! Please forgiv—

13:25.240 --> 13:29.350
Don't make me laugh! You faked 
your own death and went into hiding!

13:29.350 --> 13:31.370
I'm not falling for your scams again!

13:32.890 --> 13:35.960
Boss, don't just stand there! Help me!

13:35.960 --> 13:38.950
Making him pay with his life 
seems a little excessive.

13:38.950 --> 13:40.050
Exactly!

13:40.050 --> 13:42.500
We removed your sister's curse.

13:42.500 --> 13:45.350
That's true. Please stop this.

13:45.720 --> 13:49.570
Yes, Irene told me about that.

13:49.570 --> 13:52.600
So you got rid of the curse?

13:52.600 --> 13:54.150
We sure did!

13:52.980 --> 13:55.690
That's right. That's why we're here today—

13:56.610 --> 14:00.100
You damned scammers! You didn't 
separate the relic from her!

14:00.100 --> 14:02.240
You completely bound it to her body!

14:02.240 --> 14:04.600
That solves nothing!

14:04.600 --> 14:05.620
George!

14:05.620 --> 14:08.660
The relic was bound to her 
from the beginning.

14:09.130 --> 14:12.910
Parasitic relics aren't 
that easy to remove.

14:12.910 --> 14:15.920
Shut up! I'm not trusting you with this!

14:15.920 --> 14:19.460
I'll separate that relic from her myself!

14:20.580 --> 14:22.710
<i>This guy just doesn't listen.</i>

14:24.400 --> 14:26.420
<i>What's that? Don't tell me...</i>

14:30.620 --> 14:31.870
Stop right there!

14:31.870 --> 14:32.640
Boss?!

14:31.870 --> 14:32.640
George!

14:35.900 --> 14:38.770
<i>There's no doubt. 
That smell of rotting skin...</i>

14:38.770 --> 14:40.470
Hey! Stop right there!

14:40.470 --> 14:42.910
<i>And that repulsive aura.</i>

14:43.350 --> 14:44.390
<i>It's in here!</i>

14:53.600 --> 14:56.510
Don't you go barging into that room!

15:00.040 --> 15:03.210
Mom! What happened to her?!

15:03.210 --> 15:05.590
Hey! Who said you could come in here?!

15:05.590 --> 15:06.590
Shut up!

15:09.860 --> 15:11.680
Is your father in the same state?

15:14.640 --> 15:15.690
W-Well...

15:20.900 --> 15:22.680
How long have they been like this?

15:22.680 --> 15:25.240
They've deteriorated terribly 
over the last few weeks.

15:25.600 --> 15:28.800
But they've been sick 
for about half a year.

15:28.800 --> 15:33.750
Even the doctors don't know what it is. 
There's nothing anyone can do.

15:34.590 --> 15:36.920
What kind of disease is this?

15:38.250 --> 15:39.830
Relic Syndrome.

15:40.590 --> 15:42.500
You know this illness?

15:43.040 --> 15:47.010
I do. All too well.

15:48.750 --> 15:53.050
It breaks people down, physically and 
mentally, over a long period of time.

15:53.050 --> 15:55.520
Users with high affinity 
are the most susceptible,

15:55.890 --> 15:59.840
but it hits anyone who's been in 
contact with relics for a long time.

16:00.440 --> 16:02.020
It breaks them down?

16:02.840 --> 16:08.130
<i>If what I lived through happens again,
one third of humanity will die from it.</i>

16:08.530 --> 16:12.280
<i>In my time, the monopolists sold 
medicine made from healing relics</i>

16:12.280 --> 16:14.540
<i>and raked in enormous profits.</i>

16:15.040 --> 16:19.820
<i>I had to slave away 
for that medicine, too.</i>

16:21.000 --> 16:23.920
Then our parents are going to...

16:23.920 --> 16:25.220
There is a way.

16:27.500 --> 16:29.170
We make medicine to cure it.

16:29.170 --> 16:30.160
Medicine?

16:30.160 --> 16:33.500
I have a healing relic that 
hasn't been activated yet.

16:33.500 --> 16:35.730
I can have a cure ready in a few days.

16:37.800 --> 16:42.040
<i>What's strange is that both of them 
are already in the terminal stage.</i>

16:43.210 --> 16:45.570
<i>It progressed this far 
in just a few months?</i>

16:46.420 --> 16:48.390
<i>No, that should be impossible.</i>

16:48.390 --> 16:52.470
<i>But what if someone used a 
relic to worsen their condition?</i>

16:53.680 --> 16:56.280
Someone caused this on purpose.

16:56.620 --> 16:57.870
What?

16:59.080 --> 17:05.000
Someone artificially accelerated the 
progression of their Relic Syndrome.

17:06.590 --> 17:08.820
Who would do something like that?!

17:09.610 --> 17:12.490
That's what you need to find out now.

17:13.420 --> 17:16.690
I have to deal with the healing relic.

17:18.490 --> 17:20.560
I'll come with you!

17:20.560 --> 17:22.020
M-Me, too!

17:25.750 --> 17:27.980
Oh, the Tree of Life?

17:27.980 --> 17:30.280
And what do we do with it?

17:30.680 --> 17:33.280
We're going to find the tree's partner.

17:33.610 --> 17:34.940
Its... partner?

17:36.060 --> 17:38.290
There's a relic called Tian Fu's Relic.

17:40.550 --> 17:44.710
The Tree of Life can't be used yet.

17:45.800 --> 17:48.800
The legendary emperor knew this

17:48.800 --> 17:54.220
and tasked Tian Fu with finding a 
catalyst relic that would awaken the tree.

17:55.350 --> 17:57.640
The emperor granted his request

17:57.640 --> 18:02.440
for abundant treasures, soldiers, 
and thousands of children

18:02.440 --> 18:05.200
to serve as offerings for the undertaking.

18:07.240 --> 18:12.990
So Tian Fu set out to find the secret 
of immortality, but he never returned.

18:12.990 --> 18:17.760
All that remains of him are rumors that 
he became a king on some other continent.

18:18.200 --> 18:21.210
It's his relic we're looking for.

18:28.820 --> 18:31.630
We're searching for a relic on the subway?

18:31.630 --> 18:33.620
Are we really gonna find one here?

18:37.050 --> 18:40.060
Quit complaining. We're here.

18:43.040 --> 18:44.560
Ugh, that reeks.

18:46.150 --> 18:47.310
Rise and shine!

18:48.640 --> 18:50.570
Hey! Why would you do that?

18:53.240 --> 18:54.820
What do you think you're doing?!

18:55.110 --> 18:58.830
Oh? Edward? What are you doing here?

18:58.830 --> 19:00.280
And what happened to you?

19:00.280 --> 19:01.240
Y-You?

19:01.240 --> 19:03.250
Goriki, you bastard!

19:04.330 --> 19:08.730
Do you have any idea what I've 
been through because of you?!

19:08.730 --> 19:12.510
Because of me? I found the British 
Prime Minister, just like I promised.

19:13.040 --> 19:16.590
So what? You destroyed Kiera's relics!

19:16.590 --> 19:20.890
She thinks I'm one of your men! 
Do something about this!

19:21.310 --> 19:23.640
I will. Don't you worry.

19:23.920 --> 19:24.900
What?

19:25.880 --> 19:28.770
In exchange, I want some information.

19:29.140 --> 19:30.270
Information?

19:30.620 --> 19:34.780
Do you know about Tian Fu's Relic, 
the partner to the Tree of Life?

19:36.660 --> 19:39.300
I'm... afraid I have no idea.

19:39.300 --> 19:44.170
Come on, Edward. We're both 
on the run from Kiera here.

19:45.120 --> 19:47.270
You won't have to run anymore.

19:47.270 --> 19:51.630
If you help me, I'll make sure you rake in
a fortune without kissing America's ass.

19:52.190 --> 19:55.710
As you've probably heard,
I already have the Tree of Life.

19:55.710 --> 20:01.480
So if we can find Tian Fu's Relic, we can 
develop the first cure for Relic Syndrome.

20:01.480 --> 20:05.930
And that's not all! The healing relic 
can produce countless medicines.

20:05.930 --> 20:09.400
You'll spend the rest of your 
life swimming in money.

20:09.810 --> 20:13.070
So, what do you say? 
Doesn't that sound tempting?

20:16.120 --> 20:17.900
A pleasure to meet you.

20:18.210 --> 20:21.910
From now on, we will be 
responsible for your safety.

20:22.330 --> 20:27.160
I'm sorry. George insisted 
we bring bodyguards.

20:27.490 --> 20:30.200
The more allies, the better.

20:30.200 --> 20:31.630
They'll come in handy.

20:33.150 --> 20:37.270
<i>Edward said Tian Fu's Relic 
is in the Republic of Bent.</i>

20:37.850 --> 20:40.950
<i>And that Kiera has already 
set her sights on it.</i>

20:42.650 --> 20:46.730
But one thing is strange.

20:47.520 --> 20:52.810
Even though it involves a tomb, 
she hasn't sent a special unit.

20:52.810 --> 20:56.570
Only a small number of people 
have been assigned to it.

20:56.900 --> 20:59.600
As if she wanted to 
keep the mission secret?

20:59.600 --> 21:02.170
Yes, exactly.

21:02.810 --> 21:07.080
<i>So General Kiera is plotting 
something behind America's back.</i>

21:13.750 --> 21:15.890
All right! Let's really let loose today!

21:15.890 --> 21:17.880
I just wanna go drinking.

21:20.680 --> 21:22.610
A casino?

21:25.940 --> 21:28.840
Fine. Let's play a round.
